flowchart LR
    subgraph Hub["Hub VNet"]
        VPN[VPN Gateway]
        FW[Azure Firewall]
        AppGW[AppGW WAF v2]
    end
    subgraph Prod["Spoke prod"]
        ProdVM[VMs]
    end
    subgraph Dev["Spoke dev"]
        DevVM[VMs]
    end

    OnPrem[On-prem network] -.S2S VPN.-> VPN
    VPN -.allow-gateway-transit.-> Prod
    VPN -.allow-gateway-transit.-> Dev
    Prod -.use-remote-gateways.-> VPN
    Dev -.use-remote-gateways.-> VPN
    Prod -->|0.0.0.0/0 next-hop FW| FW
    Dev -->|0.0.0.0/0 next-hop FW| FW
    Internet((Internet)) <-- AppGW
    AppGW --> Prod
